<title>USA: CMA reports U.S. third quarter 1996 cocoa grind.</title>
<headline>CMA reports U.S. third quarter 1996 cocoa grind.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chocolate Manufacturers Association reported the following cocoa bean and product usage figures:</p>
<p>		  3RD QUARTER	   3RD QUARTER	   % CHANGE</p>
<p>		   1996			1995</p>
<p>Beans Ground    93,933		 87,360*	     + 7.52%</p>
<p>Liquor Melted    1,942		  1,915		 +1.41%</p>
<p>Butter Melted   16,757		 17,980		- 6.80%</p>
<p>*Note: Cocoa beans ground in tonnes have been adjusted to reflect currently transmitted restated and reconfirmed data for the 1995 third quarter.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
